# Vercel CLI uploads the cwd tree; these are dev/caches that must not ride
# along (the .turbo cache alone is 2.5 GB). Build inputs (root manifests,
# packages/, apps/) stay included.
node_modules
.turbo
**/.next
**/dist
**/.data
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
docs
scripts
deploy
.github
.zcode
.zcodeignore
graphify-out
*.csv
*.dump
company-logo.png
backups
